# Rain: one camera-following weather volume. The box wraps (a drop leaving the bottom re-enters at the
# top), never drains, and the count fills it once. Occlude restarts drops under a roof at the box top
# (Renderer rain occlusion map). Procedural sprite, velocity-stretched into a streak.
ParticleEffect Rain
	Emitter Drops
		Volume 30, 15, 30
		Count 60000
		FollowCamera true
		Occlude true
		# Heavy drops lean into the Particles/Wind tweaks over ~1 s.
		WindResponse 1.0
		# Centre the box below the camera so the streaks fall through the view, not above it.
		Offset 0, -10, 0
		Direction 0, -1, 0
		ConeAngle 2
		Speed 9 12
		Gravity 0
		Drag 0
		Size 0.03 0.03
		SizeVariance 0.3
		VelocityStretch 0.045
		ColorStart 0.7, 0.75, 0.85, 0.35
		ColorEnd 0.7, 0.75, 0.85, 0.35
		Additivity 0.4
		SoftFade 0.5
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0.15
